WEBVTT

52:01.318 --> 52:03.819
Wait, wait, wait, wait. I got
a better idea. How 'bout we don't?

52:03.904 --> 52:05.237
-Hey!
-Potato Head.

52:05.322 --> 52:07.281
Did you all take stupid pills
this morning?

52:07.365 --> 52:09.325
Have you forgotten
what he did to Buzz?

52:09.409 --> 52:10.951
And now you wanna let him
back over here?

52:11.036 --> 52:15.456
No! No, no, no, no, no! You got it...
You got it all wrong, Potato Head.

52:15.540 --> 52:17.875
Buzz is fine. Buzz is right here.
He's with me!

52:17.959 --> 52:21.253
-You are a liar!
-No, I'm not. Buzz, come over here.

52:21.338 --> 52:25.090
Tell the nice toys that you're...
that you're not dead.

52:27.969 --> 52:29.011
Just a sec!

52:29.095 --> 52:32.223
Buzz, will you get up here
and give me a hand?
